Funding and endorsement {#section10-0011392166616369}
-----------------------

The study was self-funded and was accepted onto the Institutional Review Board of the University of Manchester. This Board had no role in the design, implementation or evaluation of the study. After receiving written information about the study, some participants suggested that they might want to re-read the information again before answering the survey.
